# Normalise line endings. The stored blobs in this repository were a mix of LF
# and CRLF -- a few files even mixed both internally -- which meant a routine
# edit from a Windows checkout produced a diff touching every line of a file.
# `* text=auto` stores everything as LF and lets each checkout do what its
# platform wants, so a one-line change reads as a one-line change.
* text=auto

*.yml  text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.svg  text
*.png  binary
